      "en": "$txcin_upthres2"
    },
    "description": {
      "en": "This is the upper limit of the second (2%) USC rate band, currently €27,383/year, closely matching the taxes theme doc's 'Rate 2: 2% up to €27,382' for 2025 (rounding difference of €1); the theme doc also notes this threshold rises to €28,700 for 2026. It is used in txcin_ie/SchedCalc as the band_uplim parameter under 'Tax schedule: basic rates', marking the boundary between the 2% and 3% USC bands."
    },
